In his cross-examination done by the Ld. counsel for the respondent no.3 / Insurance Company,
PW-1 stated inter alia that he was wearing helmet at the time of accident; that their motorcycle was being driven by his brother at the speed of 20-30 km/hour; that they were in their extreme left lane;
that on the day and time of accident, the traffic was moving at slow speed.
